let reelShown=false;function reelTick(){const el=$('#reel');if(!el)return;const h=started&&!menu&&engine?.reelHud?.();if(!h){if(reelShown){el.hidden=true;reelShown=false;const t=$('#touch-interact');if(t)t.textContent='交互';}return;}if(!reelShown){el.hidden=false;reelShown=true;const t=$('#touch-interact');if(t)t.textContent='收线';}el.className='reel-card'+(h.pull?' pull':'')+(h.warn?' warn':'')+(h.tense>.75?' tight':'')+(h.held?' held':'');el.innerHTML=`<b>${h.water} · ${h.tier}的鱼</b><span class="reel-row"><small>鱼线</small><i class="reel-bar tense"><em style="width:${Math.round(h.tense*100)}%"></em></i></span><span class="reel-row"><small>收回</small><i class="reel-bar prog"><em style="width:${Math.round(h.prog*100)}%"></em></i></span><small class="reel-hint">${h.pull?'鱼在挣！松手':h.warn?'水面打旋了：要挣了':'按住 E（手机按住「收线」）收；线绷红了就松'}</small>`;}
